# linear-tui stores its OAuth token next to its config. Only config.json and
# prompts.json are tracked (see link.sh); this is a second line of defence so
# the token can never be committed by a stray `git add .`.
linear/credentials.json
linear/*.log
linear/*.bak

# Generic secret shapes, in case another tool's config lands here.
*credentials.json
*.pem
*.key

# Backups left by link.sh when it adopts a file an application rewrote or
# displaces a live one. They are recovery copies, not config.
*.bak
*_bak
